        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Security foundations:&lt;/b&gt; account-level stack also versions/tags the pre-existing CLI staging bucket. CloudTrail, Inspector and Macie are supporting controls, not steps in the request path.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Evaluation:&lt;/b&gt; two custom evaluators and a managed dataset are configured. onlineEvalConfigs is empty: no continuous online evaluation is configured in agentcore.json." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacing=14;fillColor=#F5F7FA;strokeColor=#D8E0EA;fontSize=13;fontColor=#526477;" vertex="1" parent="1">
